00:22:26.140 --> 00:22:28.830
I live with that every day
and so far I've made it.

00:22:28.830 --> 00:22:31.500
I mean, sure things
happen but I'm still alive

00:22:31.500 --> 00:22:33.453
and I can move forward with that.

00:22:38.450 --> 00:22:41.180
Well, my daughter was
15 so five years ago.

00:22:41.180 --> 00:22:42.540
I go on Facebook a lot

00:22:42.540 --> 00:22:45.430
and one day I just decided
to look for my daughter.

00:22:45.430 --> 00:22:49.240
And I found her on Christmas day in 2015.

00:22:49.240 --> 00:22:51.793
And we talked on Facebook.

00:22:52.720 --> 00:22:54.970
Now, mind you she's adopted.

00:22:54.970 --> 00:22:55.970
They both got adopted.

00:22:55.970 --> 00:22:58.143
So they're not supposed to talk to me.

00:22:59.310 --> 00:23:01.020
My daughter actually got in trouble.

00:23:01.020 --> 00:23:01.900
I feel bad to this day.

00:23:01.900 --> 00:23:04.990
But at the time it was a blessing to me.

00:23:04.990 --> 00:23:05.823
She got in trouble.

00:23:05.823 --> 00:23:06.780
She shut off her page

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:09.593
and her mother and father grounded her.

00:23:10.980 --> 00:23:13.910
Now, when I got out of prison in 2019,

00:23:13.910 --> 00:23:15.410
I contacted my daughter again.

00:23:16.770 --> 00:23:18.483
I also was looking for my son.

00:23:20.710 --> 00:23:22.260
I come to find out that my son,

00:23:25.710 --> 00:23:29.080
he's having a memory of
something happening to him

00:23:29.080 --> 00:23:31.260
when he was a child that
didn't occur in my life.

00:23:31.260 --> 00:23:32.540
It didn't occur when was with me

00:23:32.540 --> 00:23:35.270
but they're telling him
when he was with me.

00:23:35.270 --> 00:23:37.713
Because for whatever reason,

00:23:38.670 --> 00:23:42.620
whoever did this to him
is once again trying

00:23:42.620 --> 00:23:44.210
to tear us apart.

00:23:44.210 --> 00:23:45.820
But he remembers being locked in closets

00:23:45.820 --> 00:23:49.540
and stuff like this by some man.

00:23:49.540 --> 00:23:51.290
The only man that was ever
in my life was my husband.

00:23:51.290 --> 00:23:56.290
So now I'm getting
knowledge that he was abused

00:23:56.450 --> 00:23:58.423
in his foster, in his home.

00:24:00.940 --> 00:24:03.870
I haven't been able to find him (sniffles)

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:10.233
but (voice cracks) he'll be okay.

00:24:12.630 --> 00:24:13.580
My daughter is in college.

00:24:13.580 --> 00:24:16.313
My son supposedly has a company now.

00:24:17.860 --> 00:24:20.620
My mother is still around

00:24:22.490 --> 00:24:23.810
but I didn't really
say it in the beginning

00:24:23.810 --> 00:24:27.283
but everybody is still okay
with how they are (sniffles).

00:24:31.280 --> 00:24:33.060
They're not open-minded

00:24:33.060 --> 00:24:35.510
and money is all that they
care about (sniffles).

00:24:38.490 --> 00:24:43.490
So I come out here to skid
row because I can be me.

00:24:51.100 --> 00:24:55.870
For the most part, nobody
tells you what you have to do

00:24:55.870 --> 00:24:59.570
when you have to do it or
how much you have to be.

00:24:59.570 --> 00:25:01.930
There's really no rules.

00:25:01.930 --> 00:25:03.560
There's respect and
there's common knowledge

00:25:03.560 --> 00:25:07.590
but there's no real rules
about being homeless

00:25:07.590 --> 00:25:08.490
especially down here

00:25:08.490 --> 00:25:10.940
'cause we get everything we want and...

00:25:13.720 --> 00:25:14.610
So I'm here to get...

00:25:14.610 --> 00:25:18.190
I hate money and I receive it wonderfully

00:25:18.190 --> 00:25:22.880
but I also give it wonderfully
because having it...

00:25:22.880 --> 00:25:27.017
I know having it doesn't make
you happy from experience?

00:25:28.360 --> 00:25:31.330
To this day I know that the more I have,

00:25:31.330 --> 00:25:33.277
the more miserable I am.

00:25:33.277 --> 00:25:36.593
Unless, somebody lets
me help them with it.

00:25:37.680 --> 00:25:40.263
Even if it's getting high, if
it's getting something to eat.

00:25:41.310 --> 00:25:42.810
If it's burning it, I'll burn money

00:25:42.810 --> 00:25:45.610
because it makes me so angry
that I have it for so long.

00:25:46.770 --> 00:25:48.940
And it irritates me so
bad that people get so mad

00:25:48.940 --> 00:25:51.440
that I spend it so freely but why not?

00:25:51.440 --> 00:25:53.730
It comes freely, like really it does.

00:25:53.730 --> 00:25:56.614
And so I don't know.

00:25:56.614 --> 00:26:01.570
I've been down here since 2007 on and off,

00:26:01.570 --> 00:26:03.210
outside of my incarcerations.

00:26:03.210 --> 00:26:04.660
I return here when I get out.

00:26:07.390 --> 00:26:10.755
And I just feel that I'm where I'm at

00:26:10.755 --> 00:26:12.353
because I need to be where I'm at.

00:26:16.120 --> 00:26:16.953
I've just realized

00:26:16.953 --> 00:26:20.470
that just because of your
geographical situation

00:26:20.470 --> 00:26:25.470
or your society, your
economic status in society

00:26:25.820 --> 00:26:26.653
that's not who you are.

00:26:26.653 --> 00:26:27.830
That's just where you are.

00:26:27.830 --> 00:26:30.790
In a place that you're at and
who you are is who you are

00:26:30.790 --> 00:26:32.140
from the beginning all the way to the end

00:26:32.140 --> 00:26:33.970
as far as anything goes.

00:26:33.970 --> 00:26:35.550
It could be a religion,
it could be the gangs

00:26:35.550 --> 00:26:36.760
that you try to be in.

00:26:36.760 --> 00:26:38.690
All these things,
they're all just roadmaps

00:26:38.690 --> 00:26:39.650
of who they want you to be.

00:26:39.650 --> 00:26:41.570
And so I've just been able to become

00:26:41.570 --> 00:26:44.890
who I not necessarily want
to be but have become.

00:26:44.890 --> 00:26:49.890
So I guess in a sick kinda
way you can say I'm satisfied

00:26:50.100 --> 00:26:53.210
because I think I've
encountered a lot more things

00:26:53.210 --> 00:26:57.510
and I've made it past a lot
more obstacles and setbacks

00:26:57.510 --> 00:26:58.370
than a majority of people

00:26:58.370 --> 00:27:02.143
because I'm a willing to
go backwards to go forward.

00:27:04.226 --> 00:27:07.680
All the negativity that's
come in my life, I'm okay with

00:27:07.680 --> 00:27:09.390
because without that I
wouldn't have got stronger.

00:27:09.390 --> 00:27:11.710
And so today I have the strength
because of those things.

00:27:11.710 --> 00:27:14.883
So I'm grateful not to the
person but to the experience.

00:27:18.670 --> 00:27:20.040
And I believe that began when I was a kid

00:27:20.040 --> 00:27:22.020
because of my ignorance in the fact

00:27:22.020 --> 00:27:24.460
that sexual abuse was hindering.

00:27:24.460 --> 00:27:25.620
I didn't use it as hindrance.

00:27:25.620 --> 00:27:27.599
I used it as an advantage.

00:27:27.599 --> 00:27:30.590
So that at age three
allowed me to become 42

00:27:30.590 --> 00:27:33.560
with the strength that
nothing's gonna eliminate me

00:27:33.560 --> 00:27:38.123
but myself in any sense at all.

00:27:39.350 --> 00:27:41.610
I didn't say this at first
and I guess I totally forgot

00:27:41.610 --> 00:27:42.443
'cause it's really...

00:27:42.443 --> 00:27:45.860
I'm saying I put it to my hindsight

00:27:45.860 --> 00:27:50.540
because I have terminal cancer
and that to me is just a...

00:27:50.540 --> 00:27:52.140
It's like a piece of change in my pocket

00:27:52.140 --> 00:27:53.620
because it's just what
I carry around with me,

00:27:53.620 --> 00:27:55.420
it's not what I am.

00:27:55.420 --> 00:27:57.120
I deal with it more when I'm incarcerated

00:27:57.120 --> 00:27:59.430
because they make me do chemo.

00:27:59.430 --> 00:28:01.040
That's where I feel like I'm dying.

00:28:01.040 --> 00:28:03.070
When I'm out here, I feel fine

00:28:03.070 --> 00:28:04.450
because I'm under the
influence, first of all

00:28:04.450 --> 00:28:07.980
and secondly because I don't
have restraints or forces.

00:28:07.980 --> 00:28:10.010
I don't do my treatment out here.

00:28:10.010 --> 00:28:13.593
Now when I found out I was
pregnant I can't do chemo either.

00:28:16.350 --> 00:28:17.760
My cancer is bone marrow

00:28:17.760 --> 00:28:20.190
so what happens, I just
become really numb.

00:28:20.190 --> 00:28:23.200
My body doesn't move how
I think it should move

00:28:23.200 --> 00:28:25.000
because it doesn't know to move.

00:28:25.000 --> 00:28:25.833
I'm telling myself to

00:28:25.833 --> 00:28:27.800
but it's just kinda
basically being paralyzed.

00:28:27.800 --> 00:28:29.260
I'm supposed to be in
a wheelchair right now.

00:28:29.260 --> 00:28:32.960
They've given me two dates and
I've surpassed both of them.

00:28:32.960 --> 00:28:33.880
And as funny as it seems,

00:28:33.880 --> 00:28:36.210
my doctor said it's because I'm an addict.

00:28:36.210 --> 00:28:37.510
Because crack cocaine allows me

00:28:37.510 --> 00:28:42.510
to have an artificial
stimulant to be mobile.

00:28:42.520 --> 00:28:43.353
Because when you take your hit,

00:28:43.353 --> 00:28:48.110
your body just goes into
a supernatural place.

00:28:48.110 --> 00:28:49.500
Like where you can just go.

00:28:49.500 --> 00:28:50.670
Even if you don't want
to, you're gonna go.

00:28:50.670 --> 00:28:51.810
Like you don't care what you look like,

00:28:51.810 --> 00:28:54.010
where you are, who sees
you, you're gonna go

00:28:54.010 --> 00:28:56.030
because that's just what it said to do.

00:28:56.030 --> 00:28:59.520
So he told me...

00:28:59.520 --> 00:29:00.760
This was even prior to my pregnancy.

00:29:00.760 --> 00:29:02.960
I have to choose crack or chemo

00:29:02.960 --> 00:29:06.060
because both of them
raise my body temperature

00:29:06.060 --> 00:29:07.190
which if I'm doing both,

00:29:07.190 --> 00:29:09.140
it can cause me to have a brain aneurysm

00:29:09.140 --> 00:29:13.280
because my blood will
boil so I chose crack.

00:29:13.280 --> 00:29:15.270
And he said, I was a fourth person

00:29:15.270 --> 00:29:19.990
that he has had in his
caseload that has lived longer

00:29:19.990 --> 00:29:22.730
or benefited from their
addiction of crack cocaine.

00:29:22.730 --> 00:29:24.100
He didn't say anything
else, crack cocaine.

00:29:24.100 --> 00:29:29.100
Because of the ability of having
you could say, a jumpstart.

00:29:29.680 --> 00:29:31.230
Instead of having to do it yourself,

00:29:31.230 --> 00:29:34.170
my body doesn't work as hard
because I'm taking this hit

00:29:34.170 --> 00:29:37.290
and it's giving me energy
like a boost, like a red bull

00:29:37.290 --> 00:29:38.870
or an energy drink will give.

00:29:38.870 --> 00:29:40.150
It gives you artificial energy.

00:29:40.150 --> 00:29:41.200
That's what this crack does for me.

00:29:41.200 --> 00:29:44.440
It allows me to be mobile

00:29:44.440 --> 00:29:46.560
without having to really work at it.

00:29:46.560 --> 00:29:50.093
So like I said, the cancer is not me,

00:29:50.093 --> 00:29:51.840
it's just change in my pocket.

00:29:51.840 --> 00:29:53.310
And I feel it will be
spent sooner or later

00:29:53.310 --> 00:29:56.270
and it'll be also taken away from me so...

00:29:56.270 --> 00:29:58.340
And I found out about that in 2014

00:29:58.340 --> 00:30:00.260
because my thyroid stopped.

00:30:00.260 --> 00:30:02.973
So it's just another advantage of my life,

00:30:02.973 --> 00:30:05.250
it's to get past another hurdle

00:30:05.250 --> 00:30:07.610
and see how much longer I can go.

00:30:07.610 --> 00:30:08.803
I don't think I have...

00:30:09.936 --> 00:30:10.850
I think I have a lot longer to live.

00:30:10.850 --> 00:30:12.350
Unfortunately, sometimes I think that

00:30:12.350 --> 00:30:14.430
but other times it is
like, go to sleep, Michelle

00:30:14.430 --> 00:30:15.680
and don't wake up and you'll be just fine.

00:30:15.680 --> 00:30:16.700
But then I don't think that I will

00:30:16.700 --> 00:30:18.760
because what else haven't I done?

00:30:18.760 --> 00:30:19.593
Good or bad.

00:30:19.593 --> 00:30:21.650
So, you know--

00:30:21.650 --> 00:30:22.940
- [Mark] What do you think
is the most important lesson

00:30:22.940 --> 00:30:23.773
you've learned?

00:30:24.680 --> 00:30:27.100
- To say open-minded, to not be secluded

00:30:27.100 --> 00:30:30.700
and don't close your mind off to anything

00:30:30.700 --> 00:30:32.010
because there's so much out there

00:30:32.010 --> 00:30:34.960
and anything that happens to you,

00:30:34.960 --> 00:30:37.340
never let a set back hold you back.

00:30:37.340 --> 00:30:39.320
Don't ever let a seatbelt stay on.

00:30:39.320 --> 00:30:40.860
You have to take it off
and get out the car, right?

00:30:40.860 --> 00:30:42.810
So take off the hindrance and walk forward

00:30:42.810 --> 00:30:46.530
because that's giving that
situation the power over you

00:30:46.530 --> 00:30:48.240
so you're no longer in control.

00:30:48.240 --> 00:30:52.190
So as egotistical and as
prideful as humans are,

00:30:52.190 --> 00:30:54.860
if we allow that one
situation to slow us down

00:30:54.860 --> 00:30:56.920
then you're letting
that person control you.

00:30:56.920 --> 00:30:58.670
I don't know they chose me, we wanna say

00:30:58.670 --> 00:31:00.570
so don't let that situation control you.

00:31:00.570 --> 00:31:01.470
Just keep going forward

00:31:01.470 --> 00:31:02.880
'cause there's gonna be another one.

00:31:02.880 --> 00:31:03.713
You're gonna have to get past it.

00:31:03.713 --> 00:31:05.060
And when you stop, that's your choice.

00:31:05.060 --> 00:31:06.180
Nobody can choose for you

00:31:06.180 --> 00:31:07.637
and nobody can make a decision for you

00:31:07.637 --> 00:31:09.103
unless you allow them to.

00:31:10.090 --> 00:31:12.450
As hard as that is and as
easy as it sounds, I guess

00:31:12.450 --> 00:31:16.123
maybe that's why it's so hard
to do because it's so easy.

00:31:18.100 --> 00:31:18.933
- [Mark] All right, Michelle.

00:31:18.933 --> 00:31:21.240
Well, thank you so much for
sharing your interesting story.

00:31:21.240 --> 00:31:22.073
- And thank you.

00:31:23.076 --> 00:31:24.659
- [Mark] Thank you.

